sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Approver
  participant R as Runtime
  participant A as Authority
  participant S as Source
  U->>R: Review and approve exact plan
  R->>A: Consume into one workflow
  A-->>R: Authority-use commit
  Note over A,S: Authority and source commits are separate
  R->>R: Persist original invocation
  R->>S: Exact command and stable key
  S->>S: Recheck controls and local state
  S->>S: Local effect + operation commit
  alt Reply received
    S-->>R: Signed receipt + postconditions
  else Reply lost
    R->>R: Preserve unknown outcome
    R->>S: Look up original operation
    S-->>R: Original result or unresolved
    Note over R,S: No automatic resend
  end
  R->>R: Verify source result
  R-->>U: Verified or unresolved status
